# secrets/ is gitignored except for *.example files and holds private material
# only: private keys, tokens, passphrases. Nothing in it is read by the flake,
# because a flake only sees git-tracked files.
#
# Operator SSH *public* keys are not secrets and are committed in
#   examples/sensorica-fleet/hosts/common.nix
# under users.users.sensorica.openssh.authorizedKeys.keys (ADR-012, revised).
